UID:SeOAIDP0-VxZ1kcjspmLV
SUMMARY:Reset at Jubilee
DTSTAMP:20260821T033715Z
DTSTART:20260822T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Jubilee\, the joyful neighborhood in Hockley\, northwest of Hou
	ston\, celebrates Wellness Month with Reset\, a free evening designed to h
	elp everyone relax\, recharge\, and reconnect. \nOpen to everyone who RSVP
	s for free\, Reset offers yoga\, Zumba\, chair massages\, wellness activit
	ies and more at JoyHub\, Jubilee’s community recreation center. \nAs the e
	vening winds down\, guests will gather by the water for a beautiful floati
	ng lantern release—a peaceful way to let go\, reflect and set an intention
	 for what’s ahead. \nAdmission\nTickets are free with RSVP. RSVP now or le
	arn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event o
	rganizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLear
	n more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer acr
	oss all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/reset-
	at-jubilee/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/reset-at-jubilee/
LOCATION:Jubilee Model Home Haven\, 26134 Happy Home St\, Hockley\, TX\, 77
	447\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
