	rize\, and Grammy nominee—and her The Art of Loving Live Tour with special
	 guest Baby Rose to Downtown’s arena stage. \nThe tour supports her highly
	 anticipated album\, The Art of Loving.  \nAdmission\nTickets start at $53
	. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spons
	ored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and mo
	re details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, busin
	ess\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.
